flowchart TB
  subgraph Citizen_User
    U1[Browse map] --> U2[Create report or support issue] --> U3[Track status] --> U4[View result]
  end
  subgraph GeoIssue
    S1[Validate identity/input] --> S2[Match to issue or create issue] --> S3[Persist + expose safe public data]
  end
  subgraph Reviewer
    R1[Open review queue] --> R2[Inspect reports/support/location] --> R3[Accept / reject / prioritize] --> R4[Move to in_progress / resolved]
  end
  subgraph Admin
    A1[Manage users/roles/categories]
    A2[Review audit logs]
  end
  U2 --> S1
  S3 --> R1
  R4 --> U3
  A1 -.-> S3
  R3 -. sensitive actions logged .-> A2
